       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-UBIQUITOUS-WITNESS-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CONSTRUCTIVE-WITNESS-STATE.
           05  WS-TPA-ANKH-LOAD-VALID      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE18-CHECKSUM-MATCH    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UBIQUITOUS-COMM-VERIFIED PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REPRODUCIBLE-PROOF-MET   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-WITNESS-VERIFICATION.
           05  WS-TOTAL-WITNESS-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-EXECUTABLE-WITNESS.
           PERFORM 2000-ASSERT-COMMUNICABILITY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-WITNESS-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-EXECUTABLE-WITNESS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TPA-ANKH-LOAD-VALID.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE18-CHECKSUM-MATCH.
       2000-ASSERT-COMMUNICABILITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UBIQUITOUS-COMM-VERIFIED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REPRODUCIBLE-PROOF-MET.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-WITNESS-PROOF.
           IF WS-TPA-ANKH-LOAD-VALID = 1 AND
              WS-RULE18-CHECKSUM-MATCH = 1 AND
              WS-UBIQUITOUS-COMM-VERIFIED = 1 AND
              WS-REPRODUCIBLE-PROOF-MET = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-WITNESS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-WITNESS-CODE.
